APPLE CUTS EMPLOYEE AI BUDGETS TO REIN IN COSTS

@Apple lowered daily allowances for some engineers from $300 to $200, while evaluating further cuts to $100 and considering reductions to $25 for non-engineering staff.

The spending limits apply to external API tokens used across OpenAI's ChatGPT, Anthropic's Claude, and Google's Gemini.

